      "description": "HOBOKEN, New Jersey (Oct. 4, 2016) — The video recorder from the control cab of the lead car from NJ Transit’s Pascack Valley Line train #1614 is removed from the train as part of the National Transportation Safety Board’s investigation into the Sept. 29, 2016, crash of the train at New Jersey Transit Hoboken Terminal.  The recorder is being transported to the NTSB’s laboratory in Washington, District of Columbia, where its contents will be analyzed. (NJ Transit Police photo by Detective Laquan Hudson)",
